Package: svoya-fonts
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Description: SOS typefaces: IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Mono, Departure Mono
 IBM Plex Sans (reading), IBM Plex Mono (system facts) and Departure Mono
 (pixel labels, boot screens), with a fontconfig rule that makes Plex the
 default sans-serif and monospace families. Fonts are licensed under the
 SIL Open Font License 1.1.
